# Bound encounter of two equilibrium galaxies. G = 1.
# Each galaxy matches examples/galaxy_isolated.scene: Hernquist halo, Hernquist bulge,
# Shu stellar disk, a cold gas disk, and a hot halo. New stars heat the cold gas and pause its cooling.
# Both galaxies use the same optical colors. The picture does not tag the progenitors.
# Run the isolated scene first. Thickening that already happens alone is not a merger.
# Separation is about 24.2 and the relative speed is 0.3. Escape speed there is about 0.76.
# The halos overlap, so dynamical friction can drag the pair together.
# Put seed before the galaxy blocks.
integrator velocity_verlet
dt 0.02
steps 2500
sample_every 10
gravitational_constant 1
seed 20261009

force gravity
softening 0.03

galaxy left
particles 1000
halo_mass 2
halo_scale 2
halo_cutoff 16
disk_mass 1
disk_scale_radius 1
disk_height 0.2
dispersion_ratio 2
bulge_mass 0.3
bulge_scale 0.2
bulge_cutoff 1.6
gas_mass 0.15
gas_particles 200
gas_height 0.05
hot_gas_mass 0.08
hot_gas_particles 64
sound_speed 0.05
cooling_time 1
star_formation_time 5
feedback_energy 4
feedback_time 1
inclination 25
center -12 1.5 0
velocity 0.15 0.02 0
display_radius 0.4
color 0.98 0.91 0.72
halo_color 0.72 0.66 0.58
bulge_color 1.00 0.62 0.36
gas_color 0.96 0.42 0.55
young_color 0.64 0.80 1.00
emission 1.7
halo_emission 0.10
bulge_emission 2.6
gas_emission 0.40
young_emission 6.5

galaxy right
particles 1000
halo_mass 2
halo_scale 2
halo_cutoff 16
disk_mass 1
disk_scale_radius 1
disk_height 0.2
dispersion_ratio 2
bulge_mass 0.3
bulge_scale 0.2
bulge_cutoff 1.6
gas_mass 0.15
gas_particles 200
gas_height 0.05
hot_gas_mass 0.08
hot_gas_particles 64
sound_speed 0.05
cooling_time 1
star_formation_time 5
feedback_energy 4
feedback_time 1
inclination -40
center 12 -1.5 0
velocity -0.15 -0.02 0
display_radius 0.4
color 0.98 0.91 0.72
halo_color 0.72 0.66 0.58
bulge_color 1.00 0.62 0.36
gas_color 0.96 0.42 0.55
young_color 0.64 0.80 1.00
emission 1.7
halo_emission 0.10
bulge_emission 2.6
gas_emission 0.40
young_emission 6.5
